{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-82578","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114695","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-82579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114696","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-114697","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-114698","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-114699","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-114700","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-114701","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-82580","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114702","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-82581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114703","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-114704","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-114705","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-82582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114706","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-114707","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-82583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114708","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-114709","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-114710","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-82584","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-82585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114711","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-82586","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114712","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-82587","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-82588","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114713","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-82589","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114714","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-114715","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-114716","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-82590","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-82591","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114717","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-82592","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-114718","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-82593","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114719","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-114720","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-114721","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-114722","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-82594","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-82596","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82598","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114723","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-114724","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-82597","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114725","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-82599","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114726","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-114727","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114728","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-82601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114729","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-114730","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114731","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-82603","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82606","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114732","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-114733","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114734","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-82605","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114735","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-114736","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114737","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-82607","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114738","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-114739","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114740","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-82609","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114741","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-114742","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-114743","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-82611","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82614","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-114744","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-114745","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-114746","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-114747","t